WEBVTT

00:01:50.733 --> 00:01:53.433
As long as I have him with me,
you're powerless!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.900
This is all my fault!

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.030
Damn it.

00:01:59.066 --> 00:02:00.126
Jiro...

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.670
I can't die in a place like this.
Not before I defeat Nene...

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.633
Wait! Stop!

00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:17.666
That's too much energy!

00:02:24.266 --> 00:02:26.696
Oww... It's broken.

00:02:26.966 --> 00:02:28.666
Lord Nene is going to be upset.

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:50.633
Well, that was quite
an impressive performance.

00:02:51.233 --> 00:02:52.673
Impressive, impressive!

00:02:54.566 --> 00:02:55.566
That power...

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.800
Is it like the power of the legends,
I wonder?

00:02:59.066 --> 00:03:00.426
Wonder, wonder!

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.570
Hello. How do you do.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:12.900
This is...

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:14.370
Nene!

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:25.000
KLUKE'S FEELINGS

00:03:44.433 --> 00:03:48.203
We just received a report that
the reinforcement unit is about to arrive!

00:03:49.533 --> 00:03:50.203
Good work.

00:03:50.633 --> 00:03:51.733
Checkmate.

00:03:52.366 --> 00:03:53.026
General Logi.

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:56.426
With these new reinforcements,
we have ten times the enemy's numbers.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.230
May I ask why so many
troops are necessary?

00:03:59.666 --> 00:04:02.196
The enemy's strength lies
in their guerilla tactics.

00:04:02.633 --> 00:04:04.073
We need numbers.

00:04:04.533 --> 00:04:11.473
But even before the new reinforcements,
we already vastly outnumbered the enemy.

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.970
The former commander Korel
also led a large army.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.170
But war drew out,
and there were so many casualties.

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:22.330
Strategically, the enemy had
the advantage over us, it seems.

00:04:22.566 --> 00:04:30.196
Therefore, in order for us to win,
we require a much larger force.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.800
This way we can
minimize our casualties.

00:04:34.266 --> 00:04:37.466
I see. Lord Nene will
be very happy.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.500
That is...Nene!

00:04:51.333 --> 00:04:52.003
Bouquet!

00:04:52.033 --> 00:04:53.073
Huh? What?

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.430
Please look out for Kluke.

00:04:56.766 --> 00:04:58.296
I'm coming too, maro!

00:04:58.333 --> 00:04:59.673
Shu! Marumaro!

00:05:03.433 --> 00:05:05.633
Did you figure out
how to run away?

00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:06.866
Figure out, figure out!

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.270
Who's running away?!

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.770
I see, this is the Blue Dragon.

00:05:31.266 --> 00:05:33.666
Damn! He moves so quickly!

00:05:40.566 --> 00:05:43.166
What are you doing!
Pull yourself together!

00:05:43.433 --> 00:05:46.433
I'm together just fine!
Put your all into this!

00:05:47.533 --> 00:05:48.973
Fighting amongst yourselves?

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:50.100
Fighting, fighting!

00:05:50.166 --> 00:05:52.466
Take my punch, maro!

00:05:56.666 --> 00:05:57.766
He's quick!

00:06:00.333 --> 00:06:04.103
Come on! Fire Crisis!

00:06:10.366 --> 00:06:13.366
Now, maro! Iron Justice!

00:06:20.666 --> 00:06:22.266
Shu, I'm coming too!

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:28.570
What is this?!

00:06:29.233 --> 00:06:29.903
Kluke!

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:32.600
Can you figure out an escape route
with this terminal?

00:06:32.966 --> 00:06:33.966
I can try!

00:06:34.266 --> 00:06:36.426
We have to be prepared for the worst.

00:06:44.166 --> 00:06:46.526
There is something
that I can do, too!

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.470
Waves of Rage!

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:02.330
Now! Fire Crisis!

00:07:05.433 --> 00:07:06.433
We did it!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.700
S-So fast!
I couldn't see him!

00:07:39.966 --> 00:07:41.426
M-Maro!

00:07:47.366 --> 00:07:49.426
Maro!

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.700
The number of enemy forces
has increased even more!

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:15.200
Damn.

00:08:17.833 --> 00:08:21.873
Marumaro... What did he just do?!

00:08:23.266 --> 00:08:23.926
Jiro!

00:08:23.966 --> 00:08:24.626
Shu!

00:08:27.633 --> 00:08:28.633
Let go!

00:08:28.666 --> 00:08:30.666
Zola, watch closely!

00:08:31.066 --> 00:08:35.496
This is the Anti-Shadow Vacuum
I just developed.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.200
No. Impossible!

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:45.700
Damn. How could this be!

00:08:51.266 --> 00:08:54.826
It's similar to the Shadow-manufacturing
machine you destroyed.

00:08:55.433 --> 00:08:59.403
I'm going to fully utilize it
to create new Shadows.

00:09:05.033 --> 00:09:12.173
Don't tell me...that these pieces of junk
are the legendary Shadow Wielders.

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:21.070
He's too powerful.

00:09:21.733 --> 00:09:24.773
It's just as I feared.
This was too big a risk.

00:09:28.066 --> 00:09:29.326
Kluke! Kluke!

00:09:29.533 --> 00:09:33.373
I almost got it! I'll be able to access
the main computer soon!

00:09:33.866 --> 00:09:36.626
Okay. You keep it up.

00:09:36.966 --> 00:09:39.796
Huh? Where are you?!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:42.630
Bouquet, when did you?!

00:09:45.933 --> 00:09:47.033
I'm going.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:49.670
What?! What are you going to do?!

00:09:50.133 --> 00:09:51.773
I'm going to go rescue everyone.

00:09:52.233 --> 00:09:55.173
No! Even if you're invisible,
it's too dangerous!

00:09:55.466 --> 00:09:57.826
I know. But I have to go.

00:09:58.033 --> 00:10:01.203
That person lying on the floor
over there is my fiancÃ©.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:05.470
It seems like I gave
you guys too much credit.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.800
I thought you might be
a bit of a pain in the neck.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:10.800
It was not much of a pain at all.

00:10:10.833 --> 00:10:12.203
Not much, not much!

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:16.700
Necessity is the mother
of invention, huh?

00:10:17.133 --> 00:10:17.803
What?!

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:23.000
You must've been scared of us...
inventing all those things.

00:10:23.966 --> 00:10:26.396
You must've been really scared.

00:10:26.933 --> 00:10:31.573
That's why you did all your research
and created all of these devices.

00:10:31.933 --> 00:10:34.603
You think that a coward like you
can conquer the world?!

00:10:34.966 --> 00:10:39.526
Don't make me laugh!
Nobody would ever obey you!

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:45.600
You have developed
quite a biting little tongue

00:10:45.633 --> 00:10:47.973
in the time since
I encountered you last!

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:51.800
I wonder what your father
would say about this.

00:10:52.633 --> 00:10:55.173
He'd probably be disappointed!

00:10:58.433 --> 00:11:00.333
Shu, hang in there!

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:09.970
Shu!

00:11:10.833 --> 00:11:13.403
You used to call him Papa,
did you not?

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:18.700
Almost!

00:11:27.266 --> 00:11:29.126
I almost had it!

00:11:29.166 --> 00:11:34.026
I had a lot of trust in your papa.

00:11:38.733 --> 00:11:41.533
As a captain and a research advisor
to that excavation team...

00:11:42.066 --> 00:11:44.826
Everything was
so much fun back then.

00:11:46.166 --> 00:11:47.596
Don't underestimate me!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.630
It was that day!

00:12:01.466 --> 00:12:02.866
Papa! Papa!

00:12:03.033 --> 00:12:05.733
Don't die! Please don't die!

00:12:17.666 --> 00:12:21.966
The poor Zola who lost her father
in an unfortunate accident,

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:26.330
gave up being a little girl and
joined the army for some reason.

00:12:26.466 --> 00:12:27.996
Army, army!

00:12:28.366 --> 00:12:29.726
And why did she do that?

00:12:29.933 --> 00:12:30.603
Be quiet!

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:32.570
Because she wanted
to become strong?

00:12:32.966 --> 00:12:35.426
Or because she hated herself
for being weak?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:40.830
No, that's not it.
The real reason was...

00:12:40.933 --> 00:12:42.173
Reason, reason!

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.200
Be quiet!

00:12:43.233 --> 00:12:48.303
You wanted to become your dear papa!
A man who was strong and noble!

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:49.600
Papa, Papa!

00:12:51.466 --> 00:12:55.626
You act cool, but those children are
what's most important to you, right?

00:12:55.933 --> 00:12:58.973
You talk a good game, but you've
protected them with everything you've got.

00:12:59.633 --> 00:13:02.003
Just like...your papa did.

00:13:06.533 --> 00:13:07.233
Zola.

00:13:09.066 --> 00:13:11.996
But what you're doing isn't noble!

00:13:12.433 --> 00:13:15.773
If you want to play hero,
then don't get other people involved!

00:13:16.566 --> 00:13:19.996
What you're doing
is just playing "family."

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:22.500
Am I wrong?
Playing, playing!

00:13:22.966 --> 00:13:24.196
Is that...

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:25.170
Huh?!

00:13:25.466 --> 00:13:28.226
Is that all you have to say?!

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.300
Is that all you have to say?!

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:09.800
You don't even want to listen to me!

00:14:09.933 --> 00:14:13.933
Don't regret getting me serious!

00:14:16.066 --> 00:14:18.496
I think you're not serious enough.

00:14:18.866 --> 00:14:21.266
Hornet Assassin!

00:14:28.766 --> 00:14:30.596
Don't run! You coward!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:34.470
You're so naive!
This is how you provoke!

00:14:39.333 --> 00:14:43.773
I'll wipe out your "family" members,
one by one.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:44.430
Kluke!

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:53.970
Bouquet!

00:15:00.833 --> 00:15:02.233
No!

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:06.530
You don't need to feel guilty.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:12.930
I was just doing what Shu
asked me to do...to look after you.

00:15:22.333 --> 00:15:23.703
That's it.

00:15:24.966 --> 00:15:25.626
Bouquet!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:36.600
There's nothing that I can do
at a time like this?!

00:15:51.833 --> 00:15:52.503
Bouquet!

00:15:53.066 --> 00:15:59.096
That wasn't exactly the order I had planned.
But it doesn't change your fate, Zola.

00:16:00.633 --> 00:16:02.903
I won't let any of you
get out of here alive.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:05.770
I can't lose them here.

00:16:06.966 --> 00:16:09.496
I will...protect...

00:16:10.433 --> 00:16:12.603
I will protect them,
if it's the last thing I do!

00:16:12.833 --> 00:16:13.503
Zola!

00:16:18.966 --> 00:16:23.466
Finally, you've decided to get serious!
That's my beloved Zola!

00:16:23.966 --> 00:16:27.366
Then I guess I need to get serious too!

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.070
Shu! Open your eyes!

00:16:41.566 --> 00:16:44.766
You have to wake up!
Or Zola and everybody will be...

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:48.500
Please, Shu...
Open your eyes.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:53.730
It's not up to me.
I'm no use at all!

00:16:54.233 --> 00:16:56.773
My friend was rude.
I apologize.

00:16:58.566 --> 00:16:59.766
As you please.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.230
I see... You're a kind person.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.530
It's not like that!

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:07.370
There's no need to deny it.

00:17:08.233 --> 00:17:12.333
That kindness will someday
become your strength.

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.330
Uh-huh...

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:21.100
Kindness... Kindness isn't
a useful strength at all!

00:17:21.633 --> 00:17:23.403
Do you really think so?

00:17:24.533 --> 00:17:26.433
Hornet Assassin!

00:17:38.066 --> 00:17:42.196
It must vex you so...
to lose a battle to a coward like me.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:44.530
Are you ready?

00:17:45.433 --> 00:17:46.733
Stop!

00:17:47.866 --> 00:17:49.966
Don't hurt them anymore!

00:17:50.166 --> 00:17:50.826
Kluke!

00:17:50.866 --> 00:17:52.226
You got some guts.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:55.330
But no. Die with them.

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:04.500
No more!

00:18:07.333 --> 00:18:09.033
Die!

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.030
She's a Shadow Wielder too?!

00:18:33.066 --> 00:18:35.126
But this is the end!

00:19:11.433 --> 00:19:12.673
W-Where is everybody?

00:19:13.566 --> 00:19:16.766
Kluke, I've heard your wish.

00:19:17.266 --> 00:19:18.266
Then...

00:19:21.833 --> 00:19:23.873
I'm...glad.

00:19:24.333 --> 00:19:26.303
But you...

00:19:41.033 --> 00:19:44.203
Now, it's time...for the second act!

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.670
Where are we?

00:20:37.733 --> 00:20:39.303
What's happened to the battle?!

00:20:41.366 --> 00:20:43.126
It's an earthquake!

00:20:43.166 --> 00:20:44.926
No! Look at that!

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:55.430
The castle is crumbling.

00:20:55.666 --> 00:20:57.526
Did we win, maro?

00:20:57.566 --> 00:20:59.196
No, that's not it.

00:21:08.666 --> 00:21:10.726
W-What is that?!

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:19.700
It's huge.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.000
What the...

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:22.470
What is that, maro?

00:21:22.633 --> 00:21:24.433
It's Nene's Flying Fortress.

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:32.770
My name is Nene!

00:21:37.066 --> 00:21:41.726
I am the ruler of Grankingdom.
Starting now, I rule the entire world!

00:21:42.333 --> 00:21:43.933
What is that?!

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:46.830
Those who do not follow me
will be destroyed.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:49.930
You are welcome to resist.

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:54.000
The Grankingdom is looking for war!

00:22:12.466 --> 00:22:14.596
This is Nene's power.

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:16.200
Damn!

00:22:17.266 --> 00:22:17.926
Oh, no!

00:22:19.333 --> 00:22:21.633
Kluke is still unconscious.

00:22:22.066 --> 00:22:23.866
It's as if she's dead!

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:26.030
Don't say things like that, maro!

00:22:27.233 --> 00:22:27.903
Kluke...

00:22:28.066 --> 00:22:28.726
Kluke!

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:32.500
Kluke!

00:22:35.766 --> 00:22:39.326
Kluke!

00:24:22.266 --> 00:24:23.866
To wake up Kluke
from her ever-lasting sleep,

00:24:23.900 --> 00:24:25.630
the men have risen up
to the challenge.

00:24:25.800 --> 00:24:28.370
At times like these,
we oughta use ten alarm clocks.

00:24:28.400 --> 00:24:30.400
No, something more powerful
might be better.

00:24:30.533 --> 00:24:32.303
Maybe we should have
Minotaur punch her.

00:24:32.466 --> 00:24:35.866
My hot passionate kiss
will work the best.

00:24:37.166 --> 00:24:39.796
Next on Blue Dragon:
"A Path Towards Hope."
